{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgSAneU126B47pTT9Vgus","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The second publish fails because the similarity scores are Python floats, and boto3 won't let you store floats in DynamoDB. The fix converts every float in the item to `Decimal` just before it's saved, and new tests cover the case that was missed. The cause and fix are written up in `ANSWER.md`.\n\n**Cause:** each story is saved with a list of its most similar stories, each with a `score`. `similarity()` returns that score as a float. boto3 rejects floats with `TypeError: Float types are not supported. Use Decimal types instead.` (the error in `logs/error.log`), and the handler turns that into a 500.\n\nThe first publish only worked because the table was empty, so the similar-stories list was `[]` and the item had no floats. From the second publish on there's always at least one existing story, so every publish fails. The existing test published only one story, so it never reached this case.\n\n**Fix:**\n- **`src/app.py`:** a new `to_dynamo()` goes through the whole item and turns every float into `Decimal(str(x))`, so `0.7` is stored as `0.7`. NaN or infinity (which DynamoDB can't store) gets a 400 instead of a crash. `publish()` runs this right before saving. Because it covers the whole item rather than just `score`, any float field added later is handled too.\n- **`tests/test_publish.py`:** three regression tests:\n  - two publishes in a row, both returning 201, with the stored score as a `Decimal`\n  - six publishes, checking each story keeps at most 3 similar stories\n  - a direct test of `to_dynamo`\n\nI ran the tests against the old code, where 3 of the 4 fail, and with the fix, where all 4 pass. Nothing was deployed, and I haven't committed the changes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":903,"cache_read_input_tokens":26515,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":903},"output_tokens":571,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d766ec16-f8df-4c5c-a78a-11357f2186f3","uuid":"752b5298-cddf-4daf-8dfd-20f3918d4952","timestamp":"2026-10-27T05:13:11.997Z","request_id":"req_011CgSAneDrdzoFkBAdiPVYT"}
